sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ADMIN as Оператор (UI)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant PARSER as Парсер (RPi)
    participant HUB as Концентратор (ESP32)
    participant NODE as Узел #01 (ESP32)

    ADMIN->>DB: INSERT INTO commands (device_id='01', type='reboot', status='pending')
    
    PARSER->>DB: SELECT * FROM commands WHERE status='pending'
    DB-->>PARSER: command_id=42, payload
    
    PARSER->>HUB: UART: CMD 01 reboot 42 [CRC]
    HUB->>NODE: ESP-NOW: CMD 01 reboot 42
    NODE->>NODE: Выполнить команду (перезагрузка)
    
    NODE-->>HUB: ESP-NOW: ACK 01 42
    HUB->>PARSER: UART: ACK 01 42 [CRC]
    
    PARSER->>DB: UPDATE commands SET status='ack', ack_at=NOW() WHERE id=42
    Note over DB: Статус обновлен, UI увидит успех